nically specific case that can stand up to research-level evaluation. [zaf-064, zaf-069]\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-064\",\"zaf-069\"]}],\"contactRefs\":[{\"name\":\"Ben Seri\"}],\"priority\":2},{\"h2\":\"Tom brings enterprise-sales experience from eight years at Okta\",\"body\":[{\"text\":\"Tom Anthony is SVP, Global Sales at Zafran Security and previously held four sales roles at Okta from 2014 to 2022. [zaf-072, zaf-078]\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-072\",\"zaf-078\"]},{\"text\":\"What it means for us: frame outreach around sales-team adoption and support for global go-to-market execution. [zaf-073, zaf-078]\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-073\",\"zaf-078\"]}],\"contactRefs\":[{\"name\":\"Tom Anthony\"}],\"priority\":2}]}]}",
